  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "e3407087-9032-4d6b-a8a3-f3a0a33aeb9f",
      "title": "Leia o cartão e observe o que a outra pessoa espera quando pede um update de saúde.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1df94d90-7411-4bc0-b656-60cb80795591",
          "textContent": "<p>Na aula anterior, bastava dizer o sintoma.</p><p>Agora o outro passo é dar um update mais útil: <strong>há quanto tempo</strong> você está assim e <strong>se isso mudou</strong>.</p><p>Esse tipo de resposta aparece num chat, no trabalho ou quando alguém de casa pergunta como você está.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bd4645df-290b-43e4-9609-ae42c10d5c49",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase. Repare como o tempo aparece antes do sintoma.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "6c208261-a9af-493a-bcae-40beaf8fd822",
          "textContent": "<p>Primeiro, marque a duração do problema.</p><p><strong>Llevo dos días con tos.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Estou com tosse há dois dias.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a73e37b698b14818b3d5e6e297d80467_b02-llevo-dos-dias-con-tos.mp3?Expires=1794099633&Signature=NYfTpQ3ChsmyGe1mqwTd50G5xLDzHp6Xr~0~spYJPVXU2SdnBFeuTxgvrjhGdA9nHPZ~pHaiiT1u6iS4EsnYAEPjX03Yf5l3K4T~F6W554Cmyhl~kanITlNYGjbEZs5asxr4eS8AeTfGEWyiziEbhl~di7NxsjHjeAFt-cd6uWrXbhitt4KVQX2yuM1K3IfjtT56NAxGQNCqULPxs-IxwjFDMy8zCvmDV~MCKGrE5poL4syIDPn-JerCraKarJFZfAhgd6HffJBCEe51nx3~CpQmYU-AMjl7ESSI5eE8wFLzwb-uJ-LlUcl4hEGT0BdZE7qq1kMlkNvGr8qElqFleg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c8704836-72c7-462c-970a-e015ade0647a",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe o molde antes de passar para a mudança do quadro.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "58d9229e-e7d9-47e1-ae48-079c4f3a79a9",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>llevo + tiempo + con + sintoma</strong> ajuda a dizer desde quando o mal-estar continua.</p><p>Você pode trocar o tempo: <strong>dos días</strong>, <strong>una semana</strong>, <strong>tres noches</strong>.</p><p>O foco aqui não é a causa. O foco é a duração do que você sente.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "660ee274-28e5-4862-a5f2-d21f7b456d7b",
      "title": "Passe pelos três cartões com áudio. Observe a diferença entre piora, melhora e falta de mudança.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "207584f1-7af1-42f5-99a6-440155d0d676",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Desde ayer me encuentro peor.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Desde ontem estou pior.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/469585741186439ea5f146d29344d5f3_b04-desde-ayer-me-encuentro-peor.mp3?Expires=1794099633&Signature=m3YavYTw~hhJARCl4yqGQ22wlyGqmoRvRAAbOBl~GlemTz-QhJtzKS-bxklo0SjPZ543tGMihoFNr2aYmYmyevz1Lzw0c0qT5ZhBOaizHqpI3hfx5zhPIsmwUIKBUIYXNwxbZh0BvSwae4MJTxCwUM3OpjbMJgj5BmpCvvqfyJsov1KDufZZ7bJlnjflJLoQGkDArWHm~yToTBBlZIyWTBSs3gvVOoQA3ELasnfdnUDcyFuouxw6XXZHSZ2U2eHviWrGhfCq-haJm17e0NqIV9gTzwwvqkydx6OKfzQ0O5MCQkuLJFs09hLZRq5bPwG36Q-F~2vynUtykJm-roAVQQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "0926f979-6907-4258-bece-ff450b9ee7d0",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Hoy me encuentro mejor.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Hoje estou melhor.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/477128c2558440d888db138a9d68cae9_b04-hoy-me-encuentro-mejor.mp3?Expires=1794099633&Signature=1E4Ww8N3JAE93t1J4jYIWHjbuppYMMmnOgFWBIkX0QAGpOWLM9~921r5kEk-CowXpJOxK52K2v2720E21HIq30JmMMiPGnG0molc5~LvaHGcu~5gwunvlfB4b~sQ2UGSvCuCCC2cHRIA1YzNAtYO34dZ33VVPxVbMRDFLs7bvHLpcR9R4k-6jEKMUgR3EiSo2OTQWkXsTmlV-PJPqp4vrZnMAuSKXNtVdfl0WzGZqwnJYdjrVNlCf6fBmi8PWup12US4DAOgIqTMCQ6KqZa9xoFdl28jYG76MBkAb7qFPjDpZsP95Fnk69OiAWx4QrKP1tDiJ5kLntmNCK34ROb0ow__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "b640ec02-bd0d-4239-8d72-c3f856a1619c",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Sigo igual desde el lunes.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Continuo igual desde segunda-feira.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/066bf81a4340455bbe5f4b579bddf9e9_b04-sigo-igual-desde-el-lunes.mp3?Expires=1794099633&Signature=eripjuFvdalnA1cRdSbpjkg04SguLJgM8pVBpV4SGUplar6Z8juBrprWgQO08ORevklPAP~QJf5Jt7YLeRaMbLD8zfkNcWywLBG3zGootXKWizbcR4~bb9uSCaDcEX7EHw6~NYDmBNQrzpaTKMZzEiUdR5OML8VUBJTNKW8ahaVCJxPkjZpLO867JBHx~mbOfaWahci4kSepURkU7Yx4iUGXwdrs9XVDNVsQy5DPQVoQxBcrJR9EvXwW9QG6IN6EQFr9Gg-8ONMGx0HUrDYnyh260~7ncxppnMvwQHAPW7IOy7O4w5w2It1AefVjitY~sPoLtVg6iB1iRi3kL0JzcQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
